Objective: 
Find the password for the next lab using file size, or if the file is executable, or human readable.

Commands used:
ls - Lists stuff inside directory.
cd - Changes directory.
file ./* - Checks the file type of every file in the directory using current path.
man find - Shows the manual page of the find command.
find ./* -size 1033c - Finds the file with the given size 1033c which is 1033 bytes.
cat .file2 - Echos the stuff inside the file.

